<title>POLAND: BFK JAN NET RISES TO PLN 2.7 MLN.</title>
<headline>BFK JAN NET RISES TO PLN 2.7 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results January </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>JANUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     2.67 vs   1.25</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 4.88 vs   3.69</p>
